@startuml
title "As a Buyer, I want to get the list of items on direct sale %n() of a given genre" SSD
hidefootbox

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black

' --- Actor and participants ---
actor Buyer
participant ":MiteLovers" as System

' --- System dialog ---
Buyer -> System: Request List of Items \n on Direct Sale \n of a given Genre
activate System
System --> Buyer: Select the Genre
deactivate System
Buyer -> System: Horror
activate System
System --> Buyer: List of Items
deactivate System

@enduml